      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a bit surface-level. For the scientific side, can you go into more detail about the specific data points or logic they use to justify mandates? And for the civil liberties side, what are the actual legal or philosophical frameworks they rely on to make their case? I want to make sure I'm not just presenting one side as 'logic' and the other as just 'feelings'.",
